message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Hyperspectral: hyperspectral image processing in Python"
abstract: >-
  Sample selection (by number or percentage), Maximum Tangent Discrimination
  band selection, Maximum Likelihood Classification, K-means clustering and
  accuracy assessment (OA, AA, kappa) for hyperspectral remote-sensing imagery.
